  "limitations": [
    "Frozen official OmniDFA part1 fingerprints with a new 22-source linear head and a separately reported fixed10-shot prototype classifier; not full OmniDFA training.",
    "One deterministic per-sample view with minimum short edge256, local224crop and global tensor resize224crop, no channel normalization. This is a project adaptation of author random episodes.",
    "Part1 was selected before scoring q179. Multiple q179 names or families occur in its training list; exact backend versions and image-level overlap remain unestablished. No unseen-source generalization claim.",
    "Prototype support is exactly10 unique train groups per source, chosen by seed42 hashes without selection/evaluation tuning. It has training_epochs=null.",
    "Raw prototype cosine scores are saved. Float64 temperature1 softmax is only an uncalibrated closed-class ranking representation; no unknown-source rejection or probability claim.",
    "HF model card declares Apache-2.0 for weights; upstream code licensing is unestablished. The new adapter implements standard timm components without vendoring upstream source.",
    "OpenCLIP A22 is the main matched-selection frozen-head reference. A0 used full parent-dev selection including evaluation and is isolated as an exploratory reference.",
